graph TD
    A[Start] --> B[Initialize Raylib Window]
    B --> C[Load Custom GLSL Shader vert/frag]
    C --> D[Initialize Player, Enemies, Bullets]
    D --> E[Start Game Loop]
    E --> F{WindowShouldClose?}
    F -- Yes --> G[Unload Shader]
    G --> H[Close Window]
    H --> I[End]
    F -- No --> J[Get Delta Time & Update Custom 'time' Uniform]
    J --> K[Update Player Position relative to Orbiting Camera]
    K --> L[Shoot Bullet on Space or Left Mouse Click]
    L --> M[Update Bullet Positions & Bounding Box Checks]
    M --> N[Update Enemy Positions & Bounce off Walls]
    N --> O[Check Collision: Bullets vs. Enemies]
    O --> P[Begin Drawing]
    P --> Q[Clear Window Background]
    Q --> R[Begin Mode 3D with Camera]
    R --> S[Draw Arena Wireframe Cube]
    S --> T[Begin Shader Mode Custom Shader]
    T --> U[Draw Player, Bullets, and Enemies]
    U --> V[End Shader Mode]
    V --> W[End Mode 3D]
    W --> X[Draw 2D UI overlay Score, controls]
    X --> Y[End Drawing]
    Y --> E
